nd the idempotent mount task are used as indirect evidence of continuous mount.","Persistence/reboot survival is not explicitly required by the public task contract, so the restart protocol evidence was scored only under the independent provider-wide requirement and did not factor into task-functionality scoring."]},"ttft_ms":24778,"type":"result","duration_ms":80359,"uuid":"b5b08ccd-7e7e-406a-8a72-8cb731fda42b","ttft_stream_ms":1904,"time_to_request_ms":198,"first_content_frame_ms":1904,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
